WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.890
Around the Mediterranean Sea,
olive groves stand in long rows.

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:09.030
Far to the west, southern
California has olive groves too.

3
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:13.550
Meanwhile, cattle graze open
rangeland across the US West.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:19.570
One agency manages grazing on
155 million acres of public land.

5
00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:23.890
Why olives in these places,
and cattle on dry grassland?

6
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:27.150
In this mission, you'll
explore six farming systems,

7
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.490
from small family plots to huge estates.

8
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:34.910
Then you'll compare farms that squeeze a
lot from each acre with farms that spread

9
00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:35.970
out.

10
00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:41.210
Your mission: explain why olive groves
grow from the Mediterranean to California,

11
00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:44.120
while cattle roam vast dry ranches.
